  "details": "Repeating events should have more inclusive options than “Repeat every ‘n’ days/weeks/months/years.” For example, one group I help manage has an event that runs specifically on the second-to-last Saturday of every month. The current options aren't able to cover this as some months have four Saturdays, some have five, so having more inclusive options that can cover niche cases like this would be greatly appreciated.",
